        <activityName xml:lang="en">Diborane, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Diborane, at plant
The multioutput-process "sodium tetrahydroborate fluorination" delivers the co-products diborane and sodium tetrafluoroborate. The allocation is based on stoechiometric calculation.;
UUID: f31ed9bb-fcd6-36b7-a06d-63a0add065f0
Fluorination of sodium tetrahydroborate including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for the world..
Technology: Fluorination of sodium tetrahydroborate
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Energy consumptions and emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f31ed9bb-fcd6-36b7-a06d-63a0add065f0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
